WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.284
Jenna: Oh no. Sweetie's gone?

2
00:00:06.285 --> 00:00:11.571
Mrs. Ling: Yes. I left his cage

3
00:00:11.572 --> 00:00:16.353
unlocked. And a window in the music room was open. Mark:

4
00:00:16.354 --> 00:00:18.934
Oh boy. Coby:

5
00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:22.446
He probably flew away.

6
00:00:22.447 --> 00:00:27.226
Kara: Yeah. I bet he's far, far away by now.

7
00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:29.561
Daisy: Don't say that, Kara.

8
00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:34.976
You'll make Mrs. Ling feel even more upset!

9
00:00:34.977 --> 00:00:37.775
Mrs. Ling: I love that bird.

10
00:00:37.776 --> 00:00:41.290
I hope nothing has happened to him. Miss

11
00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:44.726
Gray: Room Two can help you look for Sweetie. Kids:

12
00:00:44.727 --> 00:00:47.257
Yeah! Miss

13
00:00:47.258 --> 00:00:51.168
Gray: Boys, please come to the music room with me.

14
00:00:51.169 --> 00:01:04.498
Girls, stay here with Mrs. Ling and look outside. Daisy: Sweetie!

15
00:01:04.499 --> 00:01:09.994
Come, Sweetie! Kara:

16
00:01:09.995 --> 00:01:11.657
He's not a dog, Daisy. He's

17
00:01:11.658 --> 00:01:13.513
a bird. Daisy:

18
00:01:13.514 --> 00:01:16.553
I know he's a bird! Jenna:

19
00:01:16.554 --> 00:01:32.646
Yeah, Kara. She can still call his name.

20
00:01:32.647 --> 00:01:35.292
I have an idea, Mrs. Ling. Sweetie

21
00:01:35.293 --> 00:01:37.690
loves music. Maybe we

22
00:01:37.691 --> 00:01:40.498
should sing. Mrs.

23
00:01:40.499 --> 00:01:49.746
Ling: Oh. That's a good idea, Jenna! Girls:

24
00:01:49.747 --> 00:01:58.609
La-la-la-la-la! Miss

25
00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:02.757
Gray: Sweetie! Where are you? Coby:

26
00:02:02.758 --> 00:02:05.811
Maybe we should put out some food for him.

27
00:02:05.812 --> 00:02:07.962
Miss Gray: Smart thinking, Coby.

28
00:02:07.963 --> 00:02:15.961
There's his food.

29
00:02:15.962 --> 00:02:19.031
Mark: I don't see him

30
00:02:19.032 --> 00:02:28.367
anywhere. Coby: Me neither. Poor Mrs.

31
00:02:28.368 --> 00:02:33.310
Ling. Mrs. Ling: Oh well. Singing was a good

32
00:02:33.311 --> 00:02:36.465
idea, girls. But I'm afraid Kara is right.

33
00:02:36.466 --> 00:02:44.224
Sweetie is far away by now.

34
00:02:44.225 --> 00:02:48.129
Daisy: No, he's not!

35
00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:50.482
Look! Mrs. Ling:

36
00:02:50.483 --> 00:02:52.250
Sweetie! Sweetie: Tweet!

37
00:02:52.251 --> 00:02:54.863
Tweet! Mrs. Ling: Sweetie loves

38
00:02:54.864 --> 00:02:57.440
music. And he loves

39
00:02:57.441 --> 00:03:01.869
flowers! I'm so glad today is Silly Hair Day!

40
00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:10.985
Jenna: Me too!

